  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/06/P1630058.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>(19 euros) Este mi&eacute;rcoles ha abierto sus puertas en la avenida Pa&iacute;s Valenci&agrave;, 45 (en la antigua Parafarmacia #Onda) Kioma, dirigida por Mar&iacute;a Jos&eacute; Bou Osuna. All&iacute; se pueden encontar perfumes desde 7,95 euros y maguillaje desde tan s&oacute;lo 1,90 euros.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/kiomamariajosebouosuna/p1630054.jpg\" alt=\"p1630054\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/kiomamariajosebouosuna/p1630056.jpg\" alt=\"p1630056\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/kiomamariajosebouosuna/p1630057.jpg\" alt=\"p1630057\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/kiomamariajosebouosuna/p1630058.jpg\" alt=\"p1630058\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/kiomamariajosebouosuna/p1630060.jpg\" alt=\"p1630060\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/kiomamariajosebouosuna/p1630062.jpg\" alt=\"p1630062\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/kiomamariajosebouosuna/p1630063.jpg\" alt=\"p1630063\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/kiomamariajosebouosuna/p1630064.jpg\" alt=\"p1630064\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/kiomamariajosebouosuna/p1630065.jpg\" alt=\"p1630065\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912